                "en": "The Little Chapel is situated in the Les Vauxbelets valley, Saint Andrew, Guernsey. It was created in July 1914, by Brother Déodat. He planned to create a miniature version of the grotto and basilica at Lourdes, the Rosary Basilica.\nThe chapel has been described as \"probably the biggest tourist attraction in Guernsey\", and \"intricate\"."
