            "image": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e8/Nevis_Pinney%27s_Beach.jpg/1280px-Nevis_Pinney%27s_Beach.jpg",
            "file": "Nevis Pinney's Beach.jpg",
