                "en": "Port Moresby Nature Park Located in capital city Papua New Guinea, this park is accredited by the Australian zoo and aquarium association. It is a facility that promotes animal care, conservation, and education.It offers botanical, zoological, and nature experiences across its 30-acre expanse.\nPort Moresby Nature Park is important to wildlife conservation in the region. The park provides a safe environment for animals and raises awareness about the importance of biodiversity conservation. Visitors can experience exhibitions and educational programs designed to foster a deep appreciation for nature and inspire action."
