                "fr": "Cristo Rei est une statue du Christ Roi de 27 mètres de hauteur à Dili, au Timor oriental.",
                "en": "The Cristo Rei of Dili (Christ the King of Dili) statue (Portuguese: Estátua do Cristo Rei de Díli, Tetun: Estátua Cristo Rei Dili) is a 27.0-metre-high (88.6 ft) colossal statue of Jesus Christ situated atop a globe at Cape Fatucama in Dili, Timor-Leste. It is one of the country's main tourist attractions.\nThe statue was designed, and its construction supervised, by Mochamad Syailillah. It was officially unveiled by President Suharto of Indonesia in 1996 as a gift from the Indonesian Government to the people of Timor Timur, the then Indonesian province."
